{"version":1,"key":"card:705","content":{"id":705,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"57983570-2067-41ba-b2fd-6114a58aae6f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想了解一家企业甚至一个国家的财务健康状况，最直接的方式就是看它的资产负债表。资产负债表是反映某一特定时刻拥有多少资源、欠下多少债务、以及所有者净资产有多少的财务报表。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"794f7809-5561-4153-8fc3-1fa69525ee03","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"资产负债表包含三个部分："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e097ae4f-0b10-455d-b6ac-0e1fcc0f506a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a96b4992-790e-4fd8-ad41-118642488b5e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a4e0449d-cd0d-4189-9e00-044005e37983","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"资产：拥有的、能带来经济利益的资源。企业的资产如现金、厂房、设备、别人欠你的货款；央行的资产则是外汇储备、持有的债券等"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"959b2899-0acc-4e3d-8fe0-70f8c1979ef3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d2fecb7f-9a28-4e8d-ad2c-8036083f0d5a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"负债：欠别人的钱或承担的义务。企业的负债如银行贷款、供应商货款、未发的工资；而央行的负债是它发出去的货币（钱本质上是央行打的欠条）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"06e561ea-ff76-4d79-898d-adc4b74731cd","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b782901d-996f-410b-83a0-efe90fc847f4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有者权益：资产减去负债后，由所有者（如股东）享有的剩余权益"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c7b8ea0a-8cf1-42fd-9aca-beb4f6a406c6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"三者的关系是：资产 = 负债 + 所有者权益。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63b1d42e-4b3e-44c0-b931-174383506655","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过资产负债表可以看出一个主体的财务健康状况。比如企业资产有 1000 万，但负债有 950 万（相当于只交了 5% 的首付），说明杠杆很高，一旦市场有风吹草动还不上钱，马上就会面临破产。又比如企业虽然资产有一个亿，但全是机器和厂房，现金很少，连工资都发不出来，这就是流动性危机。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a7447a1b-4694-4a54-bafa-ef6d1753da34","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"资产负债表不只适用于企业。通过央行的资产负债表，可以看出整个国家货币的水位和流向。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"deffef52-72ee-47bc-996a-5feb7cff86d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"企业的负债是欠别人的钱，而央行的负债是它发出去的钱（货币本质上是央行的欠条）。央行通过购买资产向市场投放货币：资产端增加的同时，负债端（即流通中的货币）也等量增加。因此，看央行买了什么资产，就能判断宏观调控的重点："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"2c771c6b-9b11-469c-98d0-3b299ff8d7a2","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a5dcc795-978f-42db-ba53-ce57b97ac1e1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e0942c24-98e6-4539-b5f1-a60f150777d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"外汇储备增多：说明央行用人民币买入大量外币，把人民币投向了出口创汇的企业"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"63fe6fe3-355f-4f36-b9a6-130b9d99df26","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dce40ad2-a1c6-48f0-9e82-9a336caea6fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对商业银行的债权增加：央行在借钱给商业银行，鼓励银行再向企业和居民放贷"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e216dfa9-a76e-4274-bfe4-df51e3c6cda7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"84013523-1f32-4acd-964f-9f515410ebaa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"持有政府债券增加：央行在买国债，相当于借钱给政府，让政府去搞基建或发福利"}]}]}]}],"tags":["经济/资产负债表","概念"],"createTime":1778482427264,"updateTime":1778928985936,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778928985936}}